    Qwen3VL: default per-image resolution to a 1,280 vision-token budget (#398)
    
    feat(qwen3vl): cap per-image/frame vision-token budget at 1,280 (min(config.maxPixels, 1280*factor²), overflow-safe), matching Qwen2.5-VL clamp to avoid unbounded O(patches²) attention blowup on full-res images. See ADR-0014.

diff --git a/Libraries/MLXVLM/Models/Qwen3VL.swift b/Libraries/MLXVLM/Models/Qwen3VL.swift
index 68d915d..57e3974 100644
