commit 57299b447656ffccbb5d10f14a7603b9dc09bf4b
Author: Kefeng Zhou <magicnight@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Jul 14 23:23:00 2026 +0700

    Make DeepseekV3Model.init public (#422)
    
    DeepseekV3Model and its members (callAsFunction, sanitize, kvHeads, model,
    loraLayers) are already public, but the initializer is internal, so it can't
    be constructed from another module. Make it public, matching GLM4MoEModel,
    so downstream code can wrap the DeepSeek V3 architecture without copying it.

